---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const root=import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout title="Product showcase" description="Explore HealthQualify's synthetic qualification workflow and find actual developer-alpha screenshots captured by automated browser testing.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> PRODUCT SHOWCASE</div><h1>See the workflow.<br/><em>Verify what is real.</em></h1><p class="lead">Explore our synthetic demonstration in-browser and access real Local Edition screenshots generated automatically on GitHub Actions. Illustrations are clearly distinguished from application captures.</p><div class="cta-row"><a class="button primary" href={root+'demo/'}>Explore interactive tour ↗</a><a class="button ghost" href="https://github.com/Tec-Wel/HealthQualify/actions/workflows/web-browser-qa.yml">Browse captured screenshots →</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section light"><div class="container"><div class="section-intro"><span class="kicker">VERIFIED FROM LOCAL APPLICATION</span><h2>Actual screen captures, synthetic data.</h2><p>The static preview build launches HealthQualify Local Edition on loopback, creates a temporary synthetic admin workspace, executes a seeded qualification, and embeds the real captured interface below. Source screenshot artifacts are also available in the browser QA workflow.</p></div>
<div class="screen-grid">
<figure class="screen-frame"><img src={root+'product-images/actual-local-overview.png'} alt="Real HealthQualify Local Edition overview captured with a temporary synthetic administrator account" width="1365" height="850" loading="lazy" /><figcaption><strong>01 — Workspace overview</strong>Real browser capture, synthetic data and local-only session.</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="screen-frame"><img src={root+'product-images/actual-local-qualification.png'} alt="Real HealthQualify qualification evidence screen after an intentionally seeded synthetic run" width="1365" height="850" loading="lazy"/><figcaption><strong>02 — Qualification evidence</strong>Actual synthetic run with seeded failures, not a formal qualification approval.</figcaption></figure>
<figure class="screen-frame"><img src={root+'product-images/actual-local-agents.png'} alt="Real HealthQualify five-investigator dashboard using only synthetic systems" width="1365" height="850" loading="lazy"/><figcaption><strong>03 — Five advisory agents</strong>Actual Local Edition interface; model inference not assumed.</figcaption></figure>
</div>
<div class="notice-panel"><strong>Availability:</strong> These images are **real screenshots captured automatically during the static preview build**, showing synthetic data. They are not regulated production evidence. While the repository remains private, accessing preview artifacts may require a GitHub sign-in. The homepage chart remains an explicitly labeled illustration.</div>
<a class="button dark" href="https://github.com/Tec-Wel/HealthQualify/actions/workflows/web-browser-qa.yml">View browser QA and screenshots ↗</a>
</div></section>
</BaseLayout>
